GAL16V8
6502 ICE

MIO  NC   A1    A2   A3   A4   A5   A6   A7   GND
NC   NC   NC    NC   NC   NC   NC   NC   CE   VCC

/CE = /MIO*A1*A2*A3*A4*A5*A6*A7

DESCRIPTION

This PLD provides the chip enable signal for the interrupt vector
controller's mask register. If M/IO is low (signalling that an I/O
address is on A0..15) and all of A1..7 are logic one, the mask
register is enabled. This corresponds to addresses $FFFE and $FFFF,
which are no unused since the interrupt controller re-vectors maskable 
interrupts to the range $FFE0..FFEF.